"Every abstract is a particular." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every abstract is a particular." .
"Every abstract quality is a quality." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every abstract quality is a quality." .
"Every abstract region is a region." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every abstract region is a region." .
"Every accomplishment is an event." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every accomplishment is an event." .
"Every accomplishment is temporally located at a non-atomic temporal interval." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every accomplishment is temporally located at a non-atomic temporal interval." .
"Every achievement is an event." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every achievement is an event." .
"Every achievement is temporally located at some atomic time interval (atom)" <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every achievement is temporally located at some atomic time interval (atom)" .
"Every agentive physical object is a physical object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every agentive physical object is a physical object." .
"Every agentive social object is a social object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every agentive social object is a social object." .
"Every amount of matter is a physical endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every amount of matter is a physical endurant." .
"Every arbitrary sum is an endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every arbitrary sum is an endurant." .
"Every atom is a particular." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every atom is a particular." .
"Every atom is something that is an abstract or that is a perdurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every atom is something that is an abstract or that is a perdurant." .
"Every endurant is a particular." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every endurant is a particular." .
"Every endurant is temporally located at a time interval." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every endurant is temporally located at a time interval." .
"Every event is a perdurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every event is a perdurant." .
"Every feature is a physical endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every feature is a physical endurant." .
"Every mental object is a non physical object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every mental object is a non physical object." .
"Every mental object specifically depends on an agentive physical object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every mental object specifically depends on an agentive physical object." .
"Every non agentive physical object is a physical object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every non agentive physical object is a physical object." .
"Every non agentive social object is a social object." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every non agentive social object is a social object." .
"Every non physical endurant is an endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every non physical endurant is an endurant." .
"Every non physical object is a non physical endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every non physical object is a non physical endurant." .
"Every perdurant has a temporal location as direct quality." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every perdurant has a temporal location as direct quality." .
"Every perdurant is a particular." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every perdurant is a particular." .
"Every perdurant is temporally located at a time interval." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every perdurant is temporally located at a time interval." .
"Every physical endurant has a spatial location as direct quality." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every physical endurant has a spatial location as direct quality." .
"Every physical endurant is an endurant." <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Every physical endurant is an endurant." .
