<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantPartOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ConstantPartOf is the constant version of Temporary Parthood which is a ternary relation between two endurants x, y and a time interval t. The intended interpretation is that the endurant x is a part of the endurant y over the time interval t.\nIn this constant version, the endurant x is part of the endurant y during the whole existence of y." .
