<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantParticipantOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantParticipantOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "constantParticipantOf is the constant version of Participation which is a ternary relation between an endurant x, a perdurant y, and a time interval t. The intended interpretation is that x participates in y at time t. Every perdurant has at least an endurant that participates in it, and every endurant participates in some perdurant. \nIn this constant version, the endurant x participates in the perdurant y during the whole existence of y." .
<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantParticipantOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
