<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantQualeOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#constantQualeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "constantQualeOf is the constant version of Temporary Quale Of which is a ternary relation among a physical region x, a physical quality y and a time interval t or among an abstract region x, an abstract quality y and a time interval t. It relates the quality to its quale (position) at a certain time.\nIn this constant version, the region x is the quale of the quality y during the whole existence of y." .
